            "review_title": "Review at 01 -wan- Tantan Ramen",
            "review_text": "Ayesha E\n9 contributions\n0\nIncredible ramen!!\nApr 2026 • Couples\nWe arrived in Hanoi late and stumbled upon this wonderful ramen restaurant at 12:30am! \nWe sat on the first floor which is bar style seating. It felt super classy and intimate, but Ming, the owner brings a chilled and friendly atmosphere. \nWe both had a ramen, I had the black sesame tantan which was recommended by Ming as my partner got the classic and it was absolutely incredible! The chef absolutely nailed it! Whilst we haven’t been to Japan, it was certainly the best ramen I have tasted! I cannot fault it! \n\nMing was so friendly and made the experience all the better! He gave us a whistle stop tour on sake, as he is a sake sommelier, so we even came away learning something new! \nWe will most definitely be visiting again when we come back to Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 26, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
