            "review_text": "Leannie\nHong Kong, China3214 contributions\n1\nFabulous date night meal\nSep 2025 • Couples\nAmazing dinner here on a sat night , they even do a date night meal deal on the weekend that is great value.\nWe enjoyed the salad appetisers, hong kong chicken with two different ramens followed by a super tasty cheesecake for afters.\nUsually I have sat at the bar stools in previous visit, but this time we sat at a table on the 3rd floor which was much more welcoming. Staff were all very friendly, they even didn't nind me moving table to avoid sitting directly under the air con.\nRead more\nWritten September 23, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
